<title>POLAND: BYTOM SWINGS TO PLN 0.5 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>BYTOM SWINGS TO PLN 0.5 MLN LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.55 vs   0.05 (profit)</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.55 vs   0.18 (profit)</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.05 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Sales		    7.00 vs   5.14</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 3.89 vs   1.02 (profit)</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   3.89 vs   2.01 (profit)</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.42 vs   5.23 (profit)</p>
<p> Sales		   44.87 vs  41.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
